2026-07-27T08:01:18.9176983Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9245116Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9245756Z i /tmp/RtmpLbcTpH/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9246084Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9246462Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9247118Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9247610Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9248316Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9248885Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9506816Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:01:18.9616218Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:01:19.0077326Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:01:19.0245509Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
